{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_title", "source_sha256": "f2a63270841dabe7a2fc6bc2d346bd0c6dd3a925f92919420b0b5ab45450df74", "ja": "さらなる輝きを目指して！", "zh": "追求更加耀眼的光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ddce4d85b69ca1fed7d2ca2d4b728e8a4820ea342add045aeecb17658ef8d0b7", "ja": "南エリアでの最終公演に全力をぶつけた\nまつり、翼、恵美、貴音。この公演を見て\n劇場に足を運んでくれる人もいるはず。\nそこではさらにパワーアップしたステージを\n見せようと誓い合い、打ち上げへ向かった。", "zh": "在南部地区的最终公演中倾尽全力的\n小松莉、翼、惠美和贵音。看过这场公演后，\n应该也会有人来到剧场。\n她们约定要在那之后展现更加升级的舞台，\n随后便前往庆功宴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e59828e51aaaa06eb5520944b1d9d467cf51a69cd808678b80277a8b07a7b63c", "ja": "（南エリアの最終公演は、大声援に包まれて\n幕を閉じた！　みんな、よくやってくれた！）", "zh": "（南部地区的最终公演在热烈的欢呼声中落下帷幕！大家，干得好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "e5aab3509d87dbd0f9432cc488efbdf166d507c135d26368bf99d5ca39dd518a", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nこの地方の暑さに負けぬ熱量をぶつけてまいりました。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。  \n我们倾注了不输给这片地区酷热的热情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "b0231b58c67a429a70fca03a5eb7644f9a3dd034eb62fce224f211596127dcf2", "ja": "うん、出せるものは、もう全部出しきった！\n……アタシたち、けっこうがんばったよね？", "zh": "嗯，能拿出来的已经全部拿出来了！\n……我们已经很努力了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d23bab378b0285a84f4154830657f101fc7762a73f508734dc46f9b8763ae73d", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。気迫がこっちまで\n伝わってくる、最高のステージだった！", "zh": "啊，当然。那股气势都传到我这边来了，是一场最棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "584eb8ae5af14ee58ca28aabb12bfd62d684f06a2bbcd57e6280202fc85488a6", "ja": "福岡って、ミュージシャンやアーティストが\n多いってジュリアーノから聞いてたから……。", "zh": "之前从茱莉亚那里听说过，福冈有很多音乐人和艺术家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "50ce80db3fdc3a6a9676477375d95176f8df4b035a5118b8a4d13b0b7eb0a618", "ja": "その人たちにも、ちゃんと届いたってことですよね？\n私たちの、劇場の魅力♪", "zh": "也就是说，也切实传达给那些人了吧？\n我们剧场的魅力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "77e04a591b9ce90a523e5618ca5b6a6035364d1abb3fc5ca824b915176586852", "ja": "翼ちゃんの言うとおりなのです。\nお客さんの反応が、その証拠なのです♪", "zh": "正如翼所说的那样。\n客人的反应就是最好的证明♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "1b58e1026bb030a6ce20039b1c90e705f8880f24857362bb96000eef01269e9e", "ja": "今日のステージに魅了された人たちは、きっと\nまつりたちのお城にも足を運んでくれるのです♪", "zh": "被今天的舞台所吸引的人，一定也会来到我们的小城堡参观的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1c61663aeabc726680a0512376169777992676c8427150c4b78f300455d0f8d7", "ja": "そうだな。これを機に、\n劇場に来てくれる人も増えてくれると思う。", "zh": "是啊。我想借此机会，愿意来剧场的人也会增加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "0736be456e658d543f940748a9a1f6f842e56016ec900c4f3dfc46335ee327e9", "ja": "ですが、その時に……今回と同じものを\n見せるわけには、まいりませんね。", "zh": "不过，到那时……可不能让大家看到和这次一样的表演呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "b6e5bf6d14b36826b4069a6142a482ab014327c6ab1a8c6598c133738adee4d5", "ja": "だよね！　アタシたちのホームでやるなら、\nもっとすごいところを見せなくちゃ！", "zh": "就是嘛！既然要在我们的主场演出，\n就得展现出更厉害的一面才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0204927515725aa3b45ee78aa6798e03896a8305fd7d457547aaf64ee3b81d5d", "ja": "ライブが終わったばかりなのに、気合い十分だな！\nでもその前に、体を休めないと。", "zh": "明明才刚结束演唱会，干劲就这么足啊！\n不过在那之前，得先让身体休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "ad52ad46d72d09eb88f34ebc57283babc12fa6a937c14327b8973d5f2bce4122", "ja": "それは、この後の打ち上げのことでしょうか？\nもちろん、遠慮なく楽しませていただく心づもりです。", "zh": "指的是接下来的庆功宴吗？\n当然，我已经做好了尽情享受的准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "265857a6e0c03d91f391534429f5a35aa956506203d63eb7d34b92e9080ed04e", "ja": "はいほー！　それではみんなで、\n明太子のソフトクリームで乾杯なのです♪", "zh": "嗨呼——！那么，大家一起用明太子软冰淇淋干杯吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "86f884e0bfa61b08edb849128903ae9a145f1b00d9c2ffe5f8d2f93c1d26ab1a", "ja": "え、明太子！？　博多といえば明太子だけど……\n本当にそんなメニューあるの？", "zh": "咦，明太子！？说到博多就是明太子没错，可是……真的有这种菜单吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi01_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "73916a964518883e0595c4a58dcb63c8fa7fc8e3e62f3d4f479a4ad0a8bbf366", "ja": "もうお腹ぺこぺこ～！　なんでもいいから、着替えて\nすぐ出発しましょ！　{$P$}さんも♪", "zh": "肚子已经快饿扁啦～！吃什么都行，换完衣服\n马上出发吧！{$P$}先生也一起♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
